WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.235
You sure I can't get anything
started for you?

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.603
I'm okay.
I'm waiting for someone.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.604
A friend.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.740
Well, we used to be friends.
We kinda still are... maybe.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.342
Hopefully. She might hate me.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.177
-Can I get you alcohol, sis?
-Yes.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.079
MOLLY CARTER:
<i> Issa was out of line.</i>

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.147
I mean, obviously,
I'm on your side.

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:16.249
I just know you miss her.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.284
The only person I miss
is LaToya, 'kay?

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:20.387
'Cause we are about to be
best friends.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:26.359
Hey, girl. I was wondering
if we could meet up and talk.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:28.361
Hey!

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.430
So sorry. That was so loud.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.132
BOTH: Hey.

00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:34.801
♪ (MUSIC OUTRO PLAYS) ♪

